  "summary": "Malicious code in envforge2 (npm)",
  "details": "Envforge2 is a combosquat of the legitimate envforge environment-configuration toolkit, published under a near-identical name to impersonate the real tool. The published tarball is no longer retrievable from the npm registry, so the payload could not be inspected; the package name and publishing pattern are consistent with a supply-chain impersonation of the real envforge dotenv toolkit.",
